### LedgerSync API requests.
### Local run: http://localhost:5080, Docker: http://localhost:8080
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health: process is alive
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health: database is reachable
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### ---------- Mock external system ----------

### Active scenario
GET {{baseUrl}}/mock/external/scenario

### Switch scenario: Baseline | Updated | Mixed | Stale | Malformed | Unavailable
PUT {{baseUrl}}/mock/external/scenario/Baseline

### Raw documents returned by the mock source
GET {{baseUrl}}/mock/external/documents

### ---------- Synchronization ----------

### Run sync (repeat it: the second run must create 0 documents)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/documents

### Sync history, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/logs?take=20

### Resend the latest run to Google Sheets (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/logs/latest/send-to-google

### ---------- Orders ----------

### Documents of an order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/ORD-001/documents

### Unknown order -> 404 problem details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/ORD-404/documents

### Invalid query -> 400 validation problem details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/logs?take=0
